<Document>
  <name>Amsterdam 20-22 Nov 2026 - 7 men</name>
  <description>Base: Holiday Inn Express North Riverside, Motorkade 1. Walk-in restaurants with vegetarian options, bars, museums and sights. Imported from the trip guide of 19 Nov 2026.</description>
